      "title": "About: Tweak a sentence about the project",
      "message": "About: Tweak a sentence about the project\n\nUncapitalize Open Source Software. Prefer the well established umbrella\nterm \"free and open source software\". Add specifics about the license\nversion.\n\nMost references use an hyphen with \"open-source\". Do that as well.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2022-07-31T11:04:36.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "A Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2022-08-02T00:26:24.000+00:00",
